WEBVTT

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:30.188
and then you figure out
how it's going to happen.

00:03:30.212 --> 00:03:33.252
I want you to understand
what is happening right now.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:38.700
Prosecutor's there --
it's the tough prosecutor.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.938
Accusing, attacking,
on behalf of we the people.

00:03:45.436 --> 00:03:47.608
The judge is up there, Judge Muckety-muck,

00:03:47.632 --> 00:03:49.380
with his black robes,

00:03:50.381 --> 00:03:52.008
and he's questioning the defendant

00:03:52.032 --> 00:03:54.166
from up there.

00:03:55.569 --> 00:03:57.355
And the defendant is three years old

00:03:57.379 --> 00:04:00.579
and the eyes don't reach
the side of the table.